---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /internship.html
title: Volunteering and internships
description: Volunteer with the EISS remotely, about a day a week for eight weeks, and leave with something published under your own name. Three cohorts a year, open to students and recent graduates.
navKey: internship
lang: en
alternates:
  en: /internship.html
  fr: /internship.fr.html
  de: /internship.de.html
---
{% from "icons.njk" import icon %}
{% set open = false %}{% for c in cohorts %}{% if not open and (c.callOpens | daysUntil) <= 0 and (c.applyBy | daysUntil) >= 0 %}{% set open = c %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}

<header class="page-header">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">Join us</span>
    <h1>Volunteering and internships</h1>
    <p class="page-lead">
      The EISS is run entirely by volunteers. Join a cohort, work remotely about a day a week for
      eight weeks, and leave with something that carries your name.
    </p>
    {% if open %}
    <p style="margin-top: var(--space-5);">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="mailto:{{ site.contactEmail }}?subject={{ open.name.en }}%20cohort">
        {{ icon("mail") }} Apply for {{ open.phrase.en }} by {{ open.applyBy | newsDate("en") }}
      </a>
    </p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</header>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 id="intakes">When you can start</h2>
    <p style="max-width: 44rem;">
      Three cohorts a year, of up to four people each. Nothing new starts between May and the
      Annual Conference in June.
    </p>

    <div class="tile-grid" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(16rem, 1fr)); margin-block: var(--space-6);">
      {% for c in cohorts %}{% if (c.end | daysUntil) >= 0 %}
      <article class="tile">
        <h3>{{ c.name.en }}</h3>
        <p><strong>{{ c.start | dateRange(c.end, "en") }}</strong></p>
        <p>{{ c.focus.en }}</p>
        {% if (c.callOpens | daysUntil) > 0 %}
        <p class="muted">Applications {{ c.callOpens | dateRange(c.applyBy, "en") }}.</p>
        {% elif (c.applyBy | daysUntil) >= 0 %}
        <p><strong>Applications open until {{ c.applyBy | newsDate("en") }}.</strong></p>
        {% else %}
        <p class="muted">Applications closed.</p>
        {% endif %}
      </article>
      {% endif %}{% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>What you would work on</h2>
    <p style="max-width: 44rem;">
      One track each, matched to what interests you. Open tasks are on the
      <a href="{{ site.helpWantedUrl }}">“help wanted” list</a>.
    </p>

    <div class="tile-grid" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(16rem, 1fr)); margin-block: var(--space-6);">
      <article class="tile">
        <div class="tile-icon" aria-hidden="true">{{ icon("search") }}</div>
        <h3>Recovering abstracts</h3>
        <p>Tracking down papers from earlier conferences and adding them to the Anthology.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="tile">
        <div class="tile-icon" aria-hidden="true">{{ icon("file-text") }}</div>
        <h3>Writing for Belvedere</h3>
        <p>A short, signed post on <a href="/blog.html">the EISS blog</a>, on a question in European security that you choose.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="tile">
        <div class="tile-icon" aria-hidden="true">{{ icon("settings") }}</div>
        <h3>Improving the data</h3>
        <p>Author names, affiliations and links to published versions, behind the Anthology and the Atlas.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="tile">
        <div class="tile-icon" aria-hidden="true">{{ icon("users") }}</div>
        <h3>The Annual Conference</h3>
        <p>Programme and logistics, from the call for papers to the event. Busiest in spring.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>The terms</h2>

    <dl class="definition-list">
      <div>
        <dt>Your name on your work</dt>
        <dd>
          A post goes out under your byline. Indexing and data work are credited by name on this
          page and in the changelog. One publishable output each, edited before it appears. We may
          decline a piece, and that does not affect the credit for the rest of your work.
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>Someone to ask</dt>
        <dd>
          A named contact from day one, meetings in weeks one, four and eight, and half an hour
          with a board member about your own research. Nobody monitors your hours.
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>Unpaid, and free to stop</dt>
        <dd>
          Nobody at the EISS is paid, the board included. Expenses agreed beforehand are reimbursed
          against receipts. There is no contract and you can stop at any point.
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>A <em lang="fr">convention de stage</em> if you need one</dt>
        <dd>
          We sign one where your course carries at least 200 hours of teaching a year, and name a
          <em lang="fr">tuteur de stage</em>. Tell us early: the paperwork goes through your
          university.
        </dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>

{# ponytail: renders nothing until src/_data/contributors.js holds a name.
   No empty state on purpose: a "nobody yet" heading advertises the opposite
   of what the section is for. Add a name and it appears. (#1354) #}
{% if contributors.length %}
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 id="contributors">Who has done this</h2>
    <p style="max-width: 44rem;">
      Volunteers who have worked on the Anthology and the conference, and what each of
      them did. Names appear here with the person's agreement.
    </p>

    <dl class="definition-list">
      {% for person in contributors %}
      <div>
        <dt>{{ person.name }}</dt>
        <dd>
          {{ person.did }}{% if person.url %} <a href="{{ person.url }}">See the work</a>.{% endif %}
        </dd>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

<section class="section-tight">
  <div class="container">
    <article class="card" style="padding: clamp(var(--space-6), 2vw + 1rem, var(--space-8));">
      <h2 style="margin-bottom: var(--space-3);">Write to us</h2>
      <p class="muted">
        Send a short note and a CV to
        <a href="mailto:{{ site.contactEmail }}?subject=Volunteering">{{ site.contactEmail }}</a>,
        saying which cohort and which track interest you. We reply to everyone within a week of the
        closing date.
      </p>
      <p class="muted" style="margin-top: var(--space-4);">
        Already a volunteer? Your first week is in <a href="{{ site.handbookUrl }}">the handbook</a>.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
